## summary

state what will be built.

## filediff tree

a treestruct of filediffs. legend: [+] create, [~] update, [-] delete

## codepath tree

a treestruct of codepaths. legend: [+] create, [~] update, [○] retain, [-] delete, [←] reuse, [→] eject

## test coverage

test coverage is a MANDATORY requirement, equal weight to implementation.
- by layer: transformers = unit; communicators, orchestrators = integration; contracts = integration + acceptance
- by case: positive, negative, happy path, edge cases
- snapshots: acceptance tests snapshot every contract stdout, success and every error path
- a test tree per codepath, with [+] / [~] / [○]

